provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34674","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[24]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"71767","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[24]}]}]},"checkedAt":1793317468133,"status":"ok","value":[{"title":"Man in a Maze","synopsis":"The mysterious death of a soldier in Greece causes suspicion. Lloyd's sends Keaton as an insurance investigator.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561311.jpg"},{"title":"Little Giant","synopsis":"Bounty hunters stakes out a former German Red Army member, Rosa. Keaton is hired by her wealthy family to protect her.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561321.jpg"},{"title":"Strange Tale of Lasagna","synopsis":"Keaton is hired to retrieve nine year old Flora from Italy. They flee for France where her mother waits.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561331.jpg"},{"title":"Immortal Man","synopsis":"Keaton saves the \"immortal man\" from the Russian Mafia. The man reveals the secret of the Romanov Treasures.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561341.jpg"},{"title":"Paris Under the Roof","synopsis":"After being fired from a college in Tokyo, Keaton finds a job as an instructor at an adult education center in France. There he meets...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561351.jpg"},{"title":"White Goddess","synopsis":"Keaton meets Anna in Scilly Islands in England, who is protecting an archaeological site all by herself.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561361.jpg"},{"title":"Memories of Summer Pudding","synopsis":"Keaton, hoping to spend the summer vacation alone with Yuriko, heads for a farmhouse where he spent summers as a boy.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561371.jpg"},{"title":"Negotiator`s Rule","synopsis":"Keaton heads for the countryside in England to rescue a kidnapped manager of a Japanese electronics corporation.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561381.jpg"},{"title":"Journey with a Lady","synopsis":"Keaton meets an arrogant old lady on a train from Germany to Switzerland who claims to be pursued by the Czech Secret Service.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561391.jpg"},{"title":"Charlie","synopsis":"Keaton helps a childhood friend Charlie Chapman, also a world-renowned detective, with the murder case of an art dealer.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561401.jpg"},{"title":"Special Menu","synopsis":"Keaton assists an Englishman to become a Chinese chef with the help of a secret recipe.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561411.jpg"},{"title":"A Case for Ladies","synopsis":"Keaton and an elderly woman who loves detective movies pursue the truth behind a high-profile murder case.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561421.jpg"},{"title":"A Peaceful Death","synopsis":"A terrorist finds his conscience and seeks Keaton's help to locate and defuse two IRA bombs in a crowded London shopping mall.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561431.jpg"},{"title":"Wall in One`s Heart","synopsis":"Keaton helps a German businessman to locate his long-lost daughter while she seeks to avenge her mother's death in a labor camp in East Germany.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561441.jpg"},{"title":"Long Hot Day","synopsis":"An attack dog ruthlessly stalks Keaton deep in the mountains of Spain.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561451.jpg"},{"title":"The Elm Tree Forever","synopsis":"Earl Fenders' bankruptcy leaves him a broken man, but his son, Robert, needs his fathers overbearing personality to inspire his music - can Keaton restore the father's domineering arrogance?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561461.jpg"},{"title":"A Mansion of Roses","synopsis":"Edmond Layman was found murdered in his rose garden and his widow fears for her life. Their gardener, Eric, disappeared and is the chief suspect but Keaton soon unburies a thorny secret!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561471.jpg"},{"title":"Faker`s Miscalculation","synopsis":"Professor Bennington runs for Chancellor to save the college only to be targeted by a team of con men. But will the con men's professional pride lead them to change their minds?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561481.jpg"},{"title":"Into the Vast Sky...","synopsis":"Keaton's daughter meets a childhood friend who wants to free a hawk. Keaton and the boy's father secretly follow out of concern for the boy who also desperately wants to be free.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561491.jpg"},{"title":"The Island of Coward","synopsis":"The Polish Mafia takes over Keaton's hotel in a blaze of gunfire. Although accused of being cowards for their inaction, Keaton and a secret legend use their experience to win despite the terrible odds.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561501.jpg"},{"title":"The Thistle Emblem","synopsis":"Keaton flies to Scotland to investigate a watch preserved in a shrine in Japan.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561511.jpg"},{"title":"Chateau Lajonchee 1944","synopsis":"Keaton visits Burgundy to insure the extraordinary vintage wine Chateau Lajonchee 1944.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561521.jpg"},{"title":"No Way Out","synopsis":"Keaton must escort a fugitive through a perilous road across a bottomless swamp.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561531.jpg"},{"title":"The Day the Op Was Born","synopsis":"Keaton recalls the first time he met Daniel and became the insurance investigator 10 years ago...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/71767/561541.jpg"}],"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
